[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Frame Dock
Name[ko]=Frame Dock (성능 패널·색 보정)
Name[ja]=Frame Dock（性能パネル・色補正）
Comment=Performance panel and display colour in SteamVR. Launch again while running to show/hide the panel.
Comment[ko]=SteamVR 안에 성능 패널과 색 보정을 띄웁니다. 실행 중에 한 번 더 실행하면 패널을 보이거나 숨깁니다
Comment[ja]=SteamVR の中に性能パネルと色補正を出す。常駐中にもう一度起動すると、パネルの表示と非表示を切り替える
# install.sh replaces the next Exec with the binary's absolute path (Steam may start it without ~/.local/bin in PATH)
Exec=@BINARY@
Icon=framedock
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;
